{
  "_help": [
    "Keyword rules for tagging post themes. Edit freely, then run `npm run retag` to re-tag existing posts.",
    "Matching ignores case and works on whole words or phrases, so 'ev' does not match inside 'every'.",
    "End a keyword with * to match any word starting with it: 'dealer*' matches dealer, dealers, dealership.",
    "A post gets the theme with the most matching keywords. On a tie, the theme listed first here wins (so Festive & greetings sits first: a Diwali post that also names a product counts as festive).",
